,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>The supporting object definitions can be optionally exported with your application. These include all configuration options and scripts.</p>',
'<ul>',
'<li>',
'<strong>Yes</strong> Includes supporting object definitions in the application export.  Does not automatically load supporting objects when invoked from a command line.',
'</li>',
'<li>',
'<strong>No</strong> Does not include the supporting object definitions in the export.',
'</li>',
'<li>',
