'',
'<p>JavaScript file URLs you enter here replaces the <code>#APPLICATION_JAVASCRIPT#</code> substitution string in the page template.</p>',
'',
'<p>Note: You do not need to include opening or closing <code>script</code> tags. Just write the URL.',
'',
