,p_pagination_display_position=>'BOTTOM_RIGHT'
,p_plug_header=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<div class="htmldbInfoBodyP">When you switch to a new theme, App Builder maps all currently used templates to a template in the new theme using the template class. This report displays these template mappings and allow for selecting alternate templat'
||'es when no templates with a matching template class exist.</div>',
