'<p>This value is used to alter <code>NLS_COMP</code> database session parameter for the execution of SQL queries in classic report, interactive report, and List view regions, as well as in plug-in API.</p>',
'Available options include:',
'<ul>',
'<li><strong>Database session NLS setting (default)</strong> - The <code>NLS_COMP</code> value is derived from the database session at runtime.</li>',
'<li><strong>Binary</strong> - Comparisons in <code>WHERE</code> clause and other SQL operations are binary.</li>',
