,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>A report query is a printable document, which can be integrated with an application using buttons, list items, branches or any other navigational components that allow for using URLs as targets.</p>',
'',
'<p>A report query is based on a standard SQL query. ',
'',
'<ul>',
'    <li>When using Oracle BI Publisher as the print server, it can be downloaded as a PDF document, a Word document (RTF based), an Excel Spreadsheet (HTML based) or as an HTML file. The layout of a report query is customizable using RTF or XSL-FO te'
||'mplates.</li>',
'    <li>When using Oracle Document Generator Pre-Built Function as the print server, it can be downloaded as a PDF document.</li>',
'</ul>',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>Note that to use this feature, your application must use a remote print server.</p>',
'',
'<p><a target="_blank" href="&SYSTEM_HELP_URL.">Learn More ...</a></p>'))
