,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>End users may have issues with correctly identifying the columns to upload based on the table''s column names. Therefore, you can define aliases for each column. These will be displayed to the end user while uploading the spreadsheet data.</p>',
'<p>If a list of values is created, the aliases will automatically be picked up by the application during data column mapping, otherwise the application will use the table column names. Once created, the list of values can also be edited and a column '
