,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'    If the operation is mapped to a column representing nested rows, all &PRODUCT_NAME. components, ',
'    which are based on the same nested rows, will select this operation.</p>',
'<p> ',
