'</div>',
'<ul>',
'    <li><strong>Wait</strong>: APEX will <em>wait</em> with the next request until the request fits into the limit again. Note that the waiting time is limited to the <strong>HTTP Transfer Timeout</strong> time, or to <strong>180 seconds</strong>, if'
