,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'    A <strong>Replace</strong> synchronization type will empty the table before loading new data. </p>',
'<p>',
'    This can either be done using a (transactional) SQL DELETE statement, which will make sure that nothing is lost if an error happens during synchronization.</p>',
'<p>',
'    The alternative is to use the SQL <em>TRUNCATE</em> statement, which leads to more efficient storage usage. However, TRUNCATE is non-transactional - so if an error happens during synchronization, the table will remain empty.</p>'))
,p_encrypt_session_state_yn=>'N'
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
