,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'Choose an existing <strong>Remote Server</strong> object. The HTTP Endpoint URL of a REST Data Source consists of the remote server (<strong>Base URL</strong>) and the service specific part. Remote Servers are stored as separate Entities. When multip'
||'le REST Data Sources share the same remote server, they can easily be redirected to another physical location (for example, from test to production) by just changing the base URL within the Remote Server definition.',
''))
