'    <em>any</em> Search Configuration, the prefix will be ignored and the whole term will be used for searching.',
'</p>',
'<p>Examples:</p>',
'<p> Two Search Configurations exist: <strong>Employees</strong> with the <strong>emp</strong>, ',
'    and <strong>Jobs</strong> with the <strong>job</strong> prefix.',
'</p>',
'<dl>',
'    <dt>emp:king president</dt>',
'    <dd>The <strong>king</strong> keyword will only be searched in the <strong>Employees</strong> ',
'        Search Configuration, <strong>president</strong> will be searched in both.</dd>',
'    <dt>emp:king job:president</dt>',
'    <dd>The <strong>king</strong> keyword will only be searched in the <strong>Employees</strong> ',
'        Search Configuration, <strong>president</strong> will only be searched in <strong>Jobs</strong>.</dd>',
'    <dt>emp:king depts:"new york"</dt>',
'    <dd>The <strong>king</strong> keyword will only be searched in the <strong>Employees</strong> ',
'        Search Configuration. <strong>depts:"new york"</strong> will be searched in both configurations,',
'        as the <strong>depts</strong> prefix is nowhere defined.</dd>',
'</dl>',
''))
,p_encrypt_session_state_yn=>'N'
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
