,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Use this field to specify a proxy server to be used by the application.</p>',
'<p>Using a proxy server may be required for REST requests done by the application, for instance when REST Data Sources or the <code>APEX_WEB_SERVICE</code> ',
'package is used.</p>',
'<p>You can reference values entered into this field from PL/SQL using the PL/SQL package variable <code>APEX_APPLICATION.G_PROXY_SERVER</code>. ',
'If no port is specified, &PRODUCT_NAME. assumes port <strong>80</strong>.</p>',
'<p>The <em>Instance Proxy</em>, which is configured in Instance Administration, always takes precedence over an application proxy server. ',
'Thus this attribute has no effect if an instance proxy is configured.</p>',
'<p>For example:</p>',
'<ul>',
'    <li><code>http://www-proxy.example.com</code></li>',
'    <li><code>http://www-proxy.example.com:8080</code></li>',
