'<p>',
'    Provide the maximum number of scheduler jobs being available ',
'    for <em>background execution</em> of page processes for this application. Only',
'    the configured number of jobs will run at the same time, to execute page',
'    processes for this application in the background. If the configured maximum amount',
'    of scheduler jobs is active, new submitted executions will wait until a job',
'    becomes available.',
'</p>',
