,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Application Processes run PL/SQL logic at specific points for each page in an application or as defined by the conditions under which they are set to fire.  Note that "Ajax Callback" processes fire only when called from Ajax or by "Run Ajax Callba'
||'ck" processes defined for pages.</p>',
