,p_name=>'P4495_RAS_MODE'
,p_is_required=>true
,p_item_sequence=>390
,p_item_plug_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(125788308327200146)
,p_use_cache_before_default=>'NO'
,p_item_default=>'0'
,p_prompt=>'RAS Mode'
,p_source=>'RAS_MODE'
,p_source_type=>'DB_COLUMN'
,p_display_as=>'NATIVE_SELECT_LIST'
,p_named_lov=>'REAL APPLICATION SECURITY MODE'
,p_lov=>'.'||wwv_flow_imp.id(125789401878207743)||'.'
,p_cSize=>32
,p_cMaxlength=>4000
,p_cHeight=>1
,p_field_template=>wwv_flow_imp.id(561547836135222071)
,p_item_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#'
,p_lov_display_extra=>'YES'
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'Define how Real Application Security should be used in this application.',
'<p/>',
'If <em>RAS Mode</em> is set to <em>Disabled</em>, Real Application Security does not get used in the application.',
'When this is set to <em>Internal Users</em>, &PRODUCT_NAME. assumes that all users are internal and passes <em>false</em> via the <em>is_external</em> parameter to <em>dbms_xs_sessions.assign_user</em>.',
'Light weight external users can be configured by setting the attribute to <em>External</em>. In that case, <em>true</em> gets passed via <em>is_external</em>.',
'<p/>',
'If you enable <em>RAS Mode</em>,',
'make sure that the users get privileges to access the application''s schema objects.',
'For <em>External Users</em>, you can for example grant database privileges to a <em>RAS Dynamic Application Role</em> and configure it in this authentication scheme as a <em>Dynamic Role</em>.',
'You can also enable roles via a call to <em>apex_authorization.enable_dynamic_groups</em>, e.g. in a Post-Authentication procedure.'))
,p_encrypt_session_state_yn=>'N'
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'page_action_on_selection', 'NONE')).to_clob
);
