||'callback.</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'<li><strong>Login Page</strong> - The Login URL defined in the application properties.</li>',
'<li><strong>Built-In Login Page</strong> - The &PRODUCT_NAME.-provided <code>wwv_flow_custom_auth_std.login_page</code>.</li>',
'<li><strong>URL</strong> - Specify a custom URL, for example <code>/login.html</code> or <code>f?p=&amp;APP_ID.:101:&amp;APP_SESSION.</code></li>',
