,p_plug_item_display_point=>'BELOW'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>'Report templates provide template control over the results of a row from a SQL query.  Report templates be defined to format an entire row or specify a specific column.  Report templates that define a cell are smaller because they need only define ea'
||'ch cell, however all cells are the same.  Use column name substitutions for example #ENAME# #JOB# or row position substitutions #1# #2# to substitute column values.  Report template conditions allow you to use a specific row template based on row col'
||'umn values or session state.   For example "#SAL# > 1000" or "''#ENAME#'' = ''SMITH''" (Note the use of quotes for text strings). Reference rownum using #ROWNUM#.'
,p_plug_query_num_rows=>150
