'Specify whether the export file should contain the application component IDs as of now or as of the last import of this application. Available options include:',
'<p />',
'<ul>',
'<li><strong>On</strong> includes the IDs as of the last import.</li>',
'<li><strong>Off</strong> includes the current IDs of the components.</li>',
'</ul>',
'<p />',
'<p />',
'Using Original IDs can be beneficial for various purposes, including:',
'<p />',
'<ul>',
'<li><strong>Readable Format:</strong> Simplify comparisons between different versions of app components and pages. Minimize changes to version controlled export files.</li>',
'<li><strong>Shared Component Subscriptions:</strong> Ensure subscribed components stay linked to a source app when it is replaced with an updated version.</li>',
'</ul>',
